[claude:event system] {"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"bhgac16d6","tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1j1aRdzRhrrz7jmsnSskX","description":"\ngcc -static -o image image.c -lm && ./image && python3 << 'EOF'\nimport math\n\ndef read_ppm(filename):\n    with open(filename, 'r') as f:\n        f.readline()\n        dims = f.readline().strip().split()\n        f.readline()\n        pixels = []\n        for line in f:\n            line = line.strip()\n            if line:\n                r, g, b = map(int, line.split())\n                pixels.append((r, g, b))\n    return pixels\n\npixels_orig = read_ppm('/app/image.ppm')\npixels_recon = read_ppm('/app/reconstructed.ppm')\n\nl2_sq = 0\nnorm1_sq = 0\nnorm2_sq = 0\ndot_product = 0\n\nfor (r1, g1, b1), (r2, g2, b2) in zip(pixels_orig, pixels_recon):\n    dr = r1 - r2\n    dg = g1 - g2\n    db = b1 - b2\n    \n    l2_sq += dr*dr + dg*dg + db*db\n    norm1_sq += r1*r1 + g1*g1 + b1*b1\n    norm2_sq += r2*r2 + g2*g2 + b2*b2\n    dot_product += r1*r2 + g1*g2 + b1*b2\n\nl2 = math.sqrt(l2_sq)\nnorm1 = math.sqrt(norm1_sq)\nnorm2 = math.sqrt(norm2_sq)\n\ncos_sim = dot_product / (norm1 * norm2) if norm1 > 0 and norm2 > 0 else 0\nl2_sim = 1.0 - (l2 / (norm1 + norm2)) if norm1 + norm2 > 0 else 0\n\nprint(f\"Cosine similarity: {cos_sim:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"L2 normalized: {l2_sim:.6f}\")\nEOF\n","is_backgrounded":false,"task_type":"local_bash","uuid":"3a1d34c7-da66-4bee-969a-fe4456230835","session_id":"d8dadbad-fa41-49c6-8f50-bf9dbcbeed9a"}
