[claude:event system] {"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"bz9n9xp4r","tool_use_id":"toolu_011SXm9KdntjaGGTnKo7LAxp","description":"\ngcc -static -o image image.c -lm && ./image && python3 << 'EOF'\nimport math\n\ndef read_ppm(filename):\n    with open(filename, 'r') as f:\n        f.readline()\n        dims = f.readline().strip().split()\n        height = int(dims[1])\n        f.readline()\n        pixels = []\n        for line in f:\n            line = line.strip()\n            if line:\n                r, g, b = map(int, line.split())\n                pixels.append((r, g, b))\n    return height, pixels\n\nh1, pixels_orig = read_ppm('/app/image.ppm')\nh2, pixels_recon = read_ppm('/app/reconstructed.ppm')\n\nw = 2400\n\n# Calculate metrics\ndot_prod_top = 0\nl2_sq_top = 0\n\nfor y in range(900):\n    for x in range(w):\n        idx = y * w + x\n        r1, g1, b1 = pixels_orig[idx]\n        r2, g2, b2 = pixels_recon[idx]\n        dot_prod_top += r1*r2 + g1*g2 + b1*b2\n        l2_sq_top += (r1-r2)**2 + (g1-g2)**2 + (b1-b2)**2\n\n# Overall\ndot_prod = 0\nl2_sq = 0\nnorm_sq_orig = 0\nnorm_sq_recon = 0\n\nfor (r1, g1, b1), (r2, g2, b2) in zip(pixels_orig, pixels_recon):\n    norm_sq_orig += r1*r1 + g1*g1 + b1*b1\n    norm_sq_recon += r2*r2 + g2*g2 + b2*b2\n    dot_prod += r1*r2 + g1*g2 + b1*b2\n    l2_sq += (r1-r2)**2 + (g1-g2)**2 + (b1-b2)**2\n\ncos_sim = dot_prod / (math.sqrt(norm_sq_orig) * math.sqrt(norm_sq_recon))\nprint(f\"Top L2: {math.sqrt(l2_sq_top):.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Overall cosine similarity: {cos_sim:.6f}\")\n\nEOF\n","is_backgrounded":false,"task_type":"local_bash","uuid":"f0aab1aa-593e-454d-b6e9-4904ebcc1c8b","session_id":"d8dadbad-fa41-49c6-8f50-bf9dbcbeed9a"}
